{"id":"5307dc528f","t":"Entomologist In Sichuan Tang Clan","c":"cv","n":112,"l":110,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan"},"u":1795038936248,"desc":"«عالِمُ الحشرات في عائلة سيتشوان-تانغ» سبايسي فابري، صانع المحتوى ذو الملايين من المتابعين المعروف بخبرته في السموم والحشرات السامة، تعرض لعضة من أفعى الممبة السوداء أثناء تصوير محلي في إفريقيا وأعيد تجسيده في عالم موريم. الآن في غابة يربي الحشرات السامة، جذب صانع المحتوى انتباه عائلة سيتشوان-تانغ، المشهورة بإتقان فنون السم، الذين يريدونه. فكيف سيقضي أيامه في عالم الموريم والقتال وخبرته في علم السموم؟!؟","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اعادة احياء","اكشن","فنون قتاليه","كوميدى","مغامرة","موريم"],"src":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/1/"},"2":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/2/"},"3":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/3/"},"4":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/4/"},"5":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/5/"},"6":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/6/"},"7":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/7/"},"8":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/8/"},"9":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/9/"},"10":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/10/"},"11":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/11/"},"12":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/12/"},"13":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan/13/"},"14":{"ml":"entomologist-in-sichuan-tang-clan|/manga/entomologist-in-si